{"id":"083ea30cb34a396c","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-prop-sat.md","title":"Propositional Satisfiability","display":"df-prop-sat — Propositional Satisfiability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-prop-sat","aliases":["57-df-prop-sat"],"display":"df-prop-sat — Propositional Satisfiability","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-prop-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-prop-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-prop-sat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prop-sat — Propositional Satisfiability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" href=\"?note=4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" title=\"57-df-prop-satisfaction\">57-df-prop-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropSat}\\)</span> (命题可满足谓词, 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"083ea30cb34a396c\" href=\"?note=083ea30cb34a396c\" title=\"57-df-prop-sat\">57-df-prop-sat</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" href=\"?note=4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" title=\"57-df-prop-satisfaction\">57-df-prop-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v: \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\to \\{0, 1\\}\">\\(v: \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\to \\{0, 1\\}\\)</span> (真值赋值, primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi\">\\(v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi\\)</span> (命题满足关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" href=\"?note=4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" title=\"57-df-prop-satisfaction\">57-df-prop-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prop\\text{-}sat} \\vdash \\mathrm{PropSat}(\\Gamma) \\Leftrightarrow \\exists v: \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\to \\{0, 1\\}\\; \\forall \\varphi \\in \\Gamma\\;(v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prop\\text{-}sat} \\vdash \\mathrm{PropSat}(\\Gamma) \\Leftrightarrow \\exists v: \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\to \\{0, 1\\}\\; \\forall \\varphi \\in \\Gamma\\;(v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropSat}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{PropSat}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> : 公式集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>是命题可满足的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v: \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\to \\{0, 1\\}\">\\(v: \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\to \\{0, 1\\}\\)</span> : 原子公式集上的真值赋值</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi\">\\(v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi\\)</span> : 赋值<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>在命题意义上满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" href=\"?note=4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" title=\"57-df-prop-satisfaction\">57-df-prop-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注：Herbrand expansion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(\\varphi)\">\\(E(\\varphi)\\)</span> 中的公式被视为命题公式，通过基例化消去了所有量词和自由变量，其原子公式被视为命题变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-prop-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ab724e3f7d0fed3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-prop-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-prop-sat","status":"resolved","id":"083ea30cb34a396c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropSat}$ (命题可满足谓词, 见 [[57-df-prop-sat]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-prop-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ab724e3f7d0fed3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$，其中 $\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$ 见 [[57-df-prop-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-prop-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ab724e3f7d0fed3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi$ (命题满足关系, see [[57-df-prop-satisfaction]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-prop-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ab724e3f7d0fed3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi$ : 赋值$v$在命题意义上满足$\\varphi$ (see [[57-df-prop-satisfaction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropSat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"v: \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\to \\{0, 1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v \\models_{\\mathrm{prop}} \\varphi","display":false},{"tex"